<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">Corinthte Khatna</book>
  <para style="h">Corinthte Khatna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Corinthte Khatna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Corinthte Khatna</para>
  <para style="mt">Corinthte Khatna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian ii deina taw Jesus Christ sawltak tu in a kisam Paul le ih suapuipa Sosthenes in —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Corinth khua ah a om Pathian ii pawlpi tung le Pathian ii mi thiangthote suak tu in a kisam sa, Jesus Christ taw kipumkhatna ah ama ii neisa a suak mi theampo, mun theampo ah amate le eite ii Topa ahi ih Topa Jesus Christ a bia mihing theampo tungah lai kong thaak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ih Pa Pathian le Topa Jesus Christ in thuthiamna le thinnopna hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesus Christ tungtawnin note a thuthiamna hong piak hu in, ka Pathian tungah note atu lungdam ka ko tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Christ taw na kipumkhat uh hu in, kampauna le heakna theampo pan kipan na theampo ah a hau na suak zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Christ ii thu sia no sungah kip takin kiphut zo ahikom,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ih Topa Jesus Christ hong kilangh tu ngakin na om laitakin, thupha khat beak zongh na taan bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa Jesus Christ ii Ni hong thet ni ciang, na pauban ngawl natu in ama in a tawpna dong kip takin hong keam si tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eima ii Topa ahi a Tapa Jesus Christ taw kipawl khawm tu a, note hong sam Pathian sia ih muan tu Pathian ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ih Topa Jesus Christ thuneina taw, ka suapui note theampo tungah kong maangkaa hi, note sungah kikhenna a om ngawl natu in, na ci uh po kithukim vadiam vun. Ngaisutna khat le tupna khat bek taw na kipawl siat vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, ka suapuite awng, note sungah kihauna om hi ci in Chloe ii innkuanpui pawlkhat in thiang takin hong son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kong cinopna pan, note khat simin thu tuatuam son nu hi. Khat in “Kei sia Paul ii nungzui ka hi hi,” ci a; a dang khat in, “Kei sia Apollos ii nungzui ka hi hi,” ci a; a dangkhat in, “Kei sia Peter ii nungzui ka hi hi,” ci a; tuaciang a dangkhat in, “Keima sia Christ ii nungzui ka hi hi,” na ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Christ sia pawl tuatuamin kikhentham hi! No atu in thinglamtee tungah a thi sia in Paul hina ziam? Paul nungzui tu in tui na kiphum uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Crispus le Gaius simngawl, note kuama tui kong phum ngawl hu in, Pathian tungah lungdam ka ko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom kuama in note sia kei nungzui suak tu in tui kiphum hi hong ci thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />(Oh hi peu hi, Stephanas le a innkuanpuite zongh tuiphum peu khi hi; tua ngawl po kuama dang tui ka phum le ka phum ngawl ciamtee ngawl khi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Christ in tuiphum tu in kei hong sawl bua hi. Ama in Lungdamna Thupha son tu in, hong sawl hi, tuaciang thinglamtee tungah Christ a thina ii vaangletna a bo thong ngawl natu in, mihing ciimna kam zangh ngawlin son tu in hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a mangthang mihingte atu in thinglamtee tungah Christ ii thina thu sia, luithawthong thu ahi hi, ahizong ngupna a nga eite atu in Pathian ii vaangletna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “Mihing a ciimte ii ciimna ka lalsak tu a, pilna saang neite ii heakna sia ka hepsak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahile mihing ciimte, pilna saang neite, ahibuale leitung ah thu kinialna a thiamte sia bang suak tu ziam? Hi leitung ciimna sia mawmawtna hi ci in Pathian in lak zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian in ama ii ciimna hong zangh a, mihingte in amate ciimna taw Pathian a heak zawk ngawl natu in vawt hi. “Mawmawt” thu hi a ci uh kote thuhilna taw, Pathian in thu umte ngup tu in khensat zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A up thei natu in Jew te in nalamdang laknate kalhsuut uh a, tuaciang Greek te in ciimna zong uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ko ka hi uh le thinglamtee tung a kithat Christ thu ka thangsak uh a, tua thu sia Jew te atu in a maktak huai thu le Gentile te atu in a luithawthong thu ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ahizong Pathian ii sapsa Jew te le Gentile te atu in hi thu sia Pathian ii vaangletna le Pathian ii ciimna ahi Christ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian ii mawmawtna bang ahi sia in mihingte ciimna sangin ciimzaw a, tuaciangin Pathian ii thazawmna bang ahi sia in mihingte thahatna sangin hat zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Suapuite awng, Pathian in note hong sap laitakin, na omzia uh ngaisun vun. Mihingte hong muna ah note sungah a ciim, ahibuale a vaanglian, ahibuale a ci thei tawm bek na om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian in mihing ciimte maizumsak natu in, leitung mite ii lui thawthong a sakte teal a, mihing thahatte a maizumsak natu in, leitung mite ii thazawm a sakte teal luih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Leitung ii thupi a sakte, a lalsak natu in leitung ii a nomu, a zawnsak le bangma in a hen ngawlte teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua sia in, Pathian mai ah a kisathei tu kuama a om bua hi, a cinopna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahihang, Pathian in note Christ Jesus taw hong kipumkhatsak zo hi; Pathian in Christ sia eite ii ciimna suaksak zo hi. Ama hangin Pathian mai ah thutang in hong koi hi; eite Pathian ii mi thiangthote suakin, hong suaktasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahiciangin laithiangtho in, “A kisuangtaak nuamte in, Topa vawtsate tungah a kisuangtaak kul tu hi,” a ci bangma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Suapuite awng, Pathian ii a thumaan thuku hil tu in note kungah kong pai lai in kamthukte le pilna thiamna kong zangh bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile note taw ka om laitakin, Jesus Christ thu, a tuanin thinglamtee tungah hong thina thute simngawl po thudang teng makngil natu ka khensat sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom note kungah kong pai lai in, thazawmin launa taw ka liingcip a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />thu kong hil ciangin mihing ciimna thiamna kammalte kong zangh bua hi, ahizong Pathian Thaa vaangletna hong lakna taw kong hil ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom note upna sia mihing ciimna tungah kinga ngawlin Pathian ii vaangletna tungah kinga zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahizongin thaa lamsang ah a khanthin sate tungah ciimna thu ka thangsak hi. Ahihang tua ciimna in hi leitung ciimna, ahibuale a bo kuan ahi, hi leitung vaangletna a nei leitung ukte ciimna ahi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ka thansak ciimna thu sia mihingte ii heak ngawl tu in a kiseal Pathian ii ciimna thuku hi a, ahihang eite minthanna tu in, leitung pian ma ngawngawn in, Pathian koi sa thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi leitung a uk mihingte kuama in, hi ciimna thu a he bua uh hi. He hile, a minthang Topa sia thinglamtee tungah a thatlum buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahitazong, laithiangtho in, “Kuama ii a mu ngeingawl a zaak ngeingawl, suak thei tu in a ngaisut ngeingawl thu sia, ama a itte atu in Pathian ii a vawtkhol sa ahi hi,” a ci bangma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in a Thaa taw tua thuku sia eite hong telsak hi. Tua Thaa in Pathian tupnate ii a kiseal a thuthukte dong ngawngawnin na theampo a kan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing khat ii thu theampo sia ama sungah a om a thaa bekma in he hi; tuabang ma in Pathian thu theampo zongh, Pathian Thaa bekma in he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eite in hi leitung ii thaa ih saang bua hi; Pathian ii hong piaksa thu theampo ih heak thei natu in, Pathian hong puak Thaa a saangte ih hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Thaa a neite tungah thaa taw kisai thumaan thutakte ka hil uh ciangin mihing ciimna ii hong hil kammalte ka pau bua uh a, Thaa ii hong hil kammalte ka pau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua Thaa a nei ngawl peuma in, Pathian Thaa kung pan hong pai thute a saang thei bua hi. Tuabang mihing khat in tua thute tel tatak ngawl hi; ama atu in tuate luithawthong thu ahi hi, banghang ziam cile thaa bulphuna taw bekin a man neina kikhentel thei ahihang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua Thaa a nei peuma in na theampo ii man neina khentel thei ahihang kuama in ama tungah thu a khen thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “Topa thinsung akua in he ziam? Akua in ama, ngaisutna pia thei tu ziam?” a ci bangma ahi hi. Ahizong, eite in Christ thinsung ih nei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Suapuite awng, a tatakin ci leang, Thaa a nei mihingte tungah ka pau bangin note tungah kong pau thei bua hi; hi leitung ii neisa, Tapidaw upna sungah patang a hite bangin note tungah kong pau kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />No sia noaitui bek taw kong vaak a, antak kong pia bua hi, banghang ziam cile antak ne thei tu na hi bualai uh hi. Tu ma zonghin antak a ne thei tu hi ngawl lai nu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />banghang ziam cile note in hi leitung mihingte nuntak zia taw ma in na nungta lai uh hi. Note sungah ki eenna om a, khat le khat na kihau uh ciangin, hi thu in note leitung neisa na hi na uh le leitung om zia taw nungta na hina uh hong lak hi ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note sung pan khat in, ‘Kei Paul nung ka zui hi,’ a dang khat in, ‘Kei Apollos nung ka zui hi,’ na ci uh ciang leitung mihingte pianzia bangin a ngamta hi ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tatakin Apollos sia akua ziam? Tuaciang Paul sia akua ziam? Kote in note ii thu na up thei natu uh in hong lampui Pathian naseamte hi bek lel khu hi. Topa ii seam a hong sawl bangin koma khat simin a seam ka hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei in thaicii ka poai a, Apollos in a kung tuibuak in, ahihang a khangtosak sia Pathian ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A poaipa le tui a buakpa sia a thupi tatak bua hi. A thupi sia in Pathian ahi hi, banghang ziam cile ama in a kung khangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A poaipa le tui a buakpa in kilamdanna nei ngawl hi; Pathian in amate sep babangin tel pia tek tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile kote sia Pathian taw kipawlin naseam khawmte ka hi uh a, note in Pathian ii lo na hi uh hi. Note in Pathian inn na hi si uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian hong piak hesuakna thupha zangh in, inn sa thiampa ii nasep teng ka seam a, a tawdap phungkawng ka phasak hi, tuaciangin ngualdang khat in tua ii tungah sa to hi. Ahihang mihing sim in, bangbangin inn kisa ziam, ci in a kidop kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian in Jesus Christ sia khat bek ahi tawdap phungkawng tu in pha zo a, a dang tawdap phungkawng a kipha thei nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawlkhatte in khamh, ahibuale ngunn, ahibuale suangmanpha sia phungkawng tungah inn sakna in zangh tu hi; a dangte in thing, ahibuale lopa, ahibuale taangphaw zangh tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciang mihing khat sim ii nasepna a phat le a phat ngawl sia Christ Ni in a pholaak ciangin kimu tu hi. Banghang ziam cile tua Ni in meikuang in mihing sim ii nasepna kilanghsak tu hi; meikuang in tua nasepnate sittel tu a, a phatna le a siatna lak thiang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Phungkawng tungah a kisa sia meikuang in a kaanghsak zo buale, inn sapa in tel nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang khat po ii nasepna sia a kaanghtum le, a nasep teng sumh tu hi; ahihang ama ahile kaanghmei sung pan a suakta khat bangin ngupna nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Note in Pathian biakinn na hi uh a, no sungah Pathian Thaa hong teang nginge ahi sia na he takpi uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom khat po in Pathian biakinn a susia le, Pathian in ama susia tu hi. Banghang ziam cile Pathian biakinn sia thiangtho a, note mama in ama biakinn na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kuama in ama le ama kitheam heak hen. Note sungah khat po in ama le ama sia, leitung paizia taw etna in, ciim a kisa le a ciim takpi ahi natu in a mawmawt phot kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile hi leitung ii ciimna hi ci in a ngaisutte sia Pathian muna ah luithawthong ahi hi. Laithiangtho in, “Pathian in a ciimte sia amate pilna thaang sungah man hi,” ci hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuaciang Laithiangtho dangkhat in, “Topa in a ciimte ngaisutna sia mannung ngawl hi, ci in he hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom kuama in mihingte vawt thei thute sungah kisuangtaak heak hen. A tatakin na theampo note neisa ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Paul, Apollos le Peter; hi leitung, nuntakna le thina, tu hun le maisang hun — hite theampo noma aa ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuaciangin note sia Christ neisa na hi uh a, Christ sia Pathian neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kote sia Pathian thumaan thukute a keamcing tu a, hong kikoi Christ ii naseamte hi ci in nong ngaisut tu uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuabang naseam khat ii a taangsap thu sia a topa tungah a thumaan tu bek ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu in kei tungah note na hi uh zong, mihing muna bang ahizong thu nong khen uh hang ka awlmaw bua hi; keima le keima zongh thu ka kikhen bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kithasunna ka nei bua hi, ahihang tuasia in mawnei ngawl tatak hi ci na ahi bua hi. Kei tungah thu hong khen sia in Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom note in a hun tatak hong thet ma in kuama tungah thu na khen heak vun. Thukhenna a khakbel sia in Topa hong pai dong a ngak kul tu hi; ama in khuazing sungah a om thukute, khuavak sungah kilanghsak tu a, tuaciang mihingte thinsung ah a kiseal tupnate a pholaak tu hi. Tuaciang mihing sim in ama taw kilawm Pathian ii pokna nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, suapuite awng, “Ngeina maante na zui vun,” a ci kam tepteena sia ii a cinopna na heak thei natu uh in hi teng theampo sia Apollos le keima tungah ka sin zo uh a, koma nii sia ettee tu lim bangin ka kizangh uh hi. Note in mihing khat pawpo kiphatsak pui in, midang khat pawpo zawngsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Akua in note ngualdangte sangin a thupizaw in hong piangsak ziam? Na neisa uh theampo Pathian hong piaksa hi ngawl ziam? Tua ahile pha hi, na neisa uhte sia letsong ahi ngawl bang phetin, bangbangin kiphatsak pui thei tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na kisap uh theampo nei zo nu ziam? A hau sa hi zo nu ziam? Ko zongh kumpi suak ngawl lai a, no kumpipate suak zo nu ziam? Pha hi, kote noma taw kumpipate ka sua khop thei natu in kumpi suak takpi le uhte kong oai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ko sawltakte sia vantunglalangte le mihing nam bup ii a et tu in mihon mai ah thidaan thuak tu mite bangin Pathian in a tawp khakna mun ma ah hong koi taw kibang ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Christ atu in kote a mawmaw ka suak uh a, ahihang note in Christ taw na kipumkhatna uh hu in, mihing ciimte na hi uh hi! Kote ka tha uh zawm a, ahihang note sia na hat uh hi: Kote hong kizawngsak ahihang note hong kizatak vawt hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi hun dong mama in kote ngilkial dangtaak in ka om uh hi; puansia ngapkaai ka sil uh a; kote hong kisaat hi; mun khat pan mun khat ah ka vak kawkoai uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />nasep haksate ka sep uh manin ka zawm dikdek uh hi. Hong kitomlaw ciangin thupha ka pia uh hi; hong kivawtsiat ciangin ka thuak uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />hong kilan ciangin kamthiam taw ka zo kik uh hi. Kote in hi leitung ninteakte bang ka hi lel uh a; tu hun dong mama in, ko sia leitung mihing nilnamte ka hi uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hisia note tungah kong atna in, no hong maizumsak nuam hi ngawlin, keima ii ka it ka tate bang a, kong pau nop hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, na Tapidaw nuntakna sungah hong keam hong en tu 10,000 na nei hial uh zong pa khat bek na nei uh hi. Banghang ziam cile Christ taw kipumkhat in na nuntakna sungah Lungdamna Thupha note tungah kong puak hu in note ii pa ka suak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahiciang keima ettee in nong zui tu uh kong dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi thu hu in, Tapidaw nuntakna sungah ka it a thumaan ka tapa Timothy kong paisak hi. Christ Jesus taw kipumkhat a, nuntakna thak sungah ka zui thubulphute le, mun theampo ah a om pawlpi teng tungah ka hil thu sia ama in hong phawksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima sia note kungah hong haw ngawl tu hi ci in nong ngaisut uh hu in, mihing pawlkhat kiphasak zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahizong Topa deina a om le, note kungah hong pai pal tu khi hi, tuasia ciang, hi mihing kiphasakte in a kam teng bek hi ngawl a, bangza vaangletna nei ziam, ci sia keima tatak ma in ka mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian Ngam in kammal taw hi ngawlin vaangletna taw kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ciang uai taw kong pai tu ahibuale ki itna le cikna taw kong pai tu a koisia deizaw nu ziam?
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu in, Pathian he ngawlte sung zongh ah a om ngeingawl, a patau huai numei le pa paktatna note sungah om hi, ci in kison takpi hi. Pasal khat sia a nu kik taw lumkhawm hi, ci in hong kison hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahile bangbangin kiphasak thei tu nu ziam? Tua ci thada, na khuangai mama natu uh hi a, tuabang a ngamta pasal sia zongh no kipawlna sung panin na hawlkhiat tu uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka pumpi sia note taw kikhuala hi kaleng, ka thaa sia note taw omkhawm nginge hi. Note taw keima hong om khawm bang keakin, hi a patau huai mama ngamtatna a neipa tungah Topa Jesus min suangin thukhenna ka pia zo hi. Na kikhop uh ciang kei zongh ka thaa taw kong kingawm a, Topa Jesus vaangletna ei sungah a om sia taw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa Ni ciang a thaa a suatak natu in, a pumpi Satan suksiat natu in tua pa ii pumpi Satan na aap vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note na kiphatsak thei natu bangma om ngawl hi! Kam teptee khat ah “Tol tawmno khat in anvuinoai bup pawmsak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na thiantho sinsen natu in, mawna tol lui sia na lakeak vun. Tua hile tol saw ngawl anvuinoai thak bang na hi tu a, tuabang takpi ma hi ci in, kong heak bang tatak ma na hi tu uh hi. Banghang ziam cile tu in Christ, ih Paisan Poai tuuno sia sangaw biakpiakna in kinei zo ahikom, ih Paisan Poai sia a kinging sa in om zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom ih ngitlona le mawna tol lui taw a kivawt anluum taw hi ngawlin tol saw ngawl thumaanna le thianthona anluum taw ih Paisan Poai khaam tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Laithak kong at sa sia sungah mihing paktatte taw na kipawl heak vun ci in kong son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu in doai bia a, mihing paktat a duhop, ahibuale a nguta, ahibuale milim a biate ka cinopna hi ngawl hi. Tuate pial natu sia, leitung pan na pusua siat uh kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu um mi khat ka hi a ci hang a paktat, a duhop, milim bia, ngual a siatson, zukham, a nguta sia taw na kipawl heak vun, ka cinopna ahi hi. Tuabang mihing khat taw ankuang uum khawm tu in na to heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tatakin a pua a om mihingte tungah thukhen tu sia kei taw kisai ngawl hi. Pathian in amate tungah thukhen tu hi. Ahihang noma pawl sung na pawlpuite tungah thu na khen tu uh hi ngawl ziam? laithiangtho sungah, “Note sung panin a ngilo mihing pa na heam vun,” a ci bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing khat in a Tapidawpuite khat taw thu a nei ciangin, Pathian ii mihingte ii a khensak tu luangin, bangbangin Pathian he ngawl thukhenmangte mai ah pai ngam ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian ii mihingte in leitung ii thukhen tu ahi hunlam he ngawl nu ziam? Pha hi, leitung ii thukhen tu na hi uhle, thunote tungtaang ah thukhen zo ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vantunglalangte tungah thukhen tu na hi uh hunlam kihe ngawl nu ziam? Tua ahile hi nuntakna sungah thute na khen thei zaw kan tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuabang thute hong piang le, pawlpi sungah dinmun a nei ngawl mihingte ii thukhen tu in paipui tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note atu in maizumhuai mama hi! Thu kinei Tapidaw puite kilaklaw ah thu a khen thei tu mihing ciim khat beak na pawl sungah om nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua hi napi in Tapidaw thunei khat in a dang khat sia thukhenzum then a, thu um ngawlte in tua thu na khensak zawpum uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note sungah na thu kineina uh mama in na nginat ngawlna uh lak hi. Ngual in no tungah hong khial le no atu phazaw ngawl ziam? Ngual in hong suttol le no atu phazaw ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuabang hi tu kimlai, khat le khat tungah khialna na kivawt uh a, suapui tatakte ngawngawn na kisuttol uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing ngilote in Pathian Ngam lua ngawl het tu ci in he nu hi. Noma le noma kitheam heak vun; mihing a paktatte le milim a biate, palngul mawna a vawtte, pa le pa, numei le numei a khialte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />na ngu theite, a duhopte, zukhamte, ngual ngensia theite, ngutate, hite kuama in Pathian Ngam lua ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note pawlkhat in tuabang na ngamta ngei uh hi. Ahihang note sia mawna panin hong kithiansua zo hi; Pathian tungah hong ki aaptuam zo hi. Topa Jesus Christ le eite Pathian ii Thaa in Pathian mai ah note thutang hong suaksak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khat po in, “Na khat pawpo ka vawt thei natu thu om hi,” ci tu hi. Hi hi; ahihang na theampo sia nang atu pha siat ngawl hi. Kei zongh na theampo ka vawt thei natu thu om hi ci thei khi hi, ahihang kei sia na khat pawpo ii sila ka kisuaksak buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khat po in, “An sia ngilpi atu hi a, ngilpi sia an atu hi,” ci tu hi. Hi hi; ahihang tuate ngeal sia Pathian in bosak tu hi. Pumpi sia numei le pa paktatna a zak tu hi ngawl a, Topa ii na seam tu ahi hi; tuaciang Topa in pumpi sia vaakin taa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian in Topa sia thina pan tho kiksak a, tuaciang ama ii vaangletna taw eite zongh hong tho kiksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na pumpite uh sia Christ' pumpi ii a khen tuatuamte ahi hunlam na he uh hi. Christ ii pumpi sungah a kihel khen khat la in pumpi zuak numei ii khen khat, suaksak tu khi ziam? Tuabang suak thei ngawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahibuale pumpi zuak numei taw a pumpi a ngawm sia in ama taw cii le sa in pumkhat tak khat suak ahi hunlam he ngawl na hi bua uh ziam? Laithiangtho in, “Tuate nii in pumkhat suak tu hi,” ci in thiang takin son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa taw a kingawm khat sia ahile ama taw Thaa thu sungah pumkhat suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Paktatnate na pial vun. Mihing khat ii mawna dang khat a vawt sia in a pumpi a lalsak bua hi; ahihang numei le pa lamsang a paktatna taw a maw sia ama pumpi tungah maw ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na pumpi uh sia Pathian hong piak, note sungah a teang Thaa Thiangtho ii biakinn ahi hunlam he ngawl nu ziam? Note pumpi sia noma neisa hi ngawl a, Pathian neisa ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ama in note man pia a, hong leisa na hi uh hi. Tua ahikom na pumpi uh sia Pathian minthan natu in zangh tavun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu in, nong laithakna uh thute huvau kong son tu hi. Pasal khat sia zi nei ngawlin om le pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahihang paktat ngamtatna tam mama ahikom, pasal khat simin zi khat a nei tu hi a, numei khat simin pasal khat a nei tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasal in a zi tungah a vaipuak zo a, zi in pasal tungah a vaipuak zo in, a kitaangsapna tetek ah kilungkimsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zi in ama ii pumpi a uk hi ngawl a, a pasal ii uk ahi hi; tuasia bangma in a pasal in ama ii pumpi a uk hi ngawl a, a zi ii uk ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hun khat sung thungetna in hun na zak thei natu uh thukimna nei masa na hi bua na uh le, khat le khat na kinial heak vun; ahihang tua zawkciangin nupa ngeinate zom kik vun. Hi bangin hi le uhte pumpi kitek laakna hangin, a piang Satan ze etna na lel natu uh pan kikeam zo tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi bang kong ci ciang thu hong pia hi ngawl a, a zangh nuamte zak thei hi cina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tatakin ci leang note theampo, keima bangin om thei le uhte kong oai zaw hi; ahitazong, mihing sim in Pathian tel ih saan tuam tek om a, khat atu in hi tel, a dang khat atu in tua tel, ci in om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu in zi le pasal nei ngawl laite le meingongte atu in keima bangin, noma nguak ma om suak le uhte phazaw hi ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang cii le sa deina, na kitek zo bua uh le, zi le pasal nei vangiat tavun — uukna taw ommawk sangin kiteenna in phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kiteang sa mite atu in keima aituam thupiakna hi ngawlin, Topa thupiakna taw thu kong pia hi: zi in a pasal nusia ngawl het tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ahihang a nusia le ama nguakin tang om top tu hi, tua ahibuale a pasal taw kilem kikna vawt tu hi; tuaciang pasal khat in a zi khul thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A dangte tungah (Topa ci hi ngawl a, keima ci hi): Christ mihing khat in thu um ngawl zi a nei a, tua nu in ama taw a teang tan tu in a thukim le, ama in a zi khul thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciangin Tapidaw numei khat ii pasal sia thu um ngawl khat hi a, ahihang a zi taw a teang tan tu in a thukim le a zi in khul thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a zi taw a kingawmna hangin thu um ngawl pasal khat sia Pathian in saang thei hi, tuaciang thu um ngawl zi khat sia Tapidaw pasal khat taw a kingawm uh hu in Pathian in saang thei hi. Hi bang hi ngawl hi thong le a tate sia doai biate tanote taw kibang tu uh hi; ahihang tu a bangin, Pathian in tua tate saang thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahizong thu um ngawl sia in, a teenpui Tapidaw sia a nusia nuam le, nusia thei hi. Tuabang thute sungah Tapidaw ahi zaw sia in, zi ahizong, pasal ahizong, ama uuk bangin ngamta thei hi. Pathian in thinnopna sungah nungta tu in nang hong sam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tapidaw zi khat in a pasal ngupna a ngasak zawk tu le a ngasak zawk ngawl tu ahizong, Tapidaw pasal khat in a zi ngupna a ngasak zawk tu le a ngasak zawk ngawl tu sia, he natu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Note khat simin Topa ii tel hong piak bang le Pathian ii hong sap lai na om uh bangin nungta suak tavun. Hisia in pawlpi theampo tungah zui tu ka hil thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vunteap ki at sa khat in Pathian sapna a saang le ama in vunteap at kitepteenate vawk tu hanciam kul ngawl hi. Vunteap a ki at ngawl khat in, Pathian sapna a saang le, vunteap at kul ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile pasal khat vunteap at le at ngawl sia bangma thupi ngawl hi; Pathian thupiakte zui tu sia a thupi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian ii sapna a saan hun lai a, a omzia babangin, mihing khat simin om tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian hong sam laitakin sila khat na hi ziam? Phamaw ngawl hi; ahihang a suakta khat na sua thei natu hunpha na nga le tuasia zangh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Topa ii a sapsa sila khat sia Topa atu a suakta ahi hi; tuasia bangma in, Christ ii a sapsa a suakta mihing khat sia Christ ii sila ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian in man pia in hong leisa na hi uh hi; tua ahikom mihingte sila na suak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, note khat simin hong kisap lai hun a na omzia uh bangin, Pathian taw kithawlin na om top tu uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu in zi nei ngawl pasal nei ngawlte huvau nong dokna taw kisai in: Topa tung panin thupiakna nga ngawl khi hi. Ahihang Topa hesuakna taw a muan taak khat bangin keima ngaisutna kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu a thinngimna a om sia ngaisun leang, pa khat in ama om babangin a om po tu sia phazaw ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zi na nei zo ziam? Tuabang na nei zo le kikhen tu sawm heak in. Zi nei ngawl lai ni ziam? Tua ahile zi zong heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahihang zi na nei le mawna khat a vawt na hi bua hi; pasal nei ngawl numei khat in, pasal a nei le ama in mawna vawt ahi bua hi. Ahihang a kiteang mihingte ii ni simin a thuak thei ngimnate taw kipeal le uhte hong oai ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, ka ci nop sia in hisia ahi hi: hun tam om nawn ngawl ahiciang, tu pan kipan zi nei pasal neite in a nei ngawl bangin om tu uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a kapte, a hee ngawl bang; a nuite, a lungdam ngawl bang; na a leite, a leisa nate a nei ngawl bang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />leitung thil le vanhte taw kisai in nasep neite in tuate taw hunbit a komla ngawl bangin a om uh kul tu hi. Banghang ziam cile hi leitung in tu a bang ahile, ngei kip nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thinngimna pan na suatak tu sia kong deisak hi. Zi nei ngawl khat in Topa nasepna thinbot hi, banghang ziam cile ama in Topa lungkim natu hanciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahihang zi nei khat in leitung nate thinbot hi, banghang ziam cile, a zi lungkimsak nuam hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />tua ahikom ama sia a lang le a lang mun nii panin kikai hi. Pasal nei ngawl numei ahibuale ngaknu thiangtho khat in Topa ii nasepna thinbot hi, banghang ziam cile ama in a pumpi le a thaa kipum aap nuam hi; ahihang pasal nei numei khat in leitung nate thinbot hi, banghang ziam cile ama in a pasal lungkimsak nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hi bang teng kong sonna in, noma kong hu nopna hang ahi hi. Note tungah kikhaatnate hong pia nuam hi ngawl khi hi. Tua hizaw ngawlin, a maan le ahi tu bangin seamin, Topa ii na, na sepna sungah kheet nei ngawlin noma le noma na kibuppiak tu ka deina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nupa kop tu in a kilungkim sa, a teang ngawl tu in a khensatte thu huvau: a pa sia in a teenpui buale numei tungah a kilawm bangin ngamta ngawl kisa a, tuaciangin cii le sa uukna nasia mama ahikom a kiteen ngawlin phamaw hi ci in a ngaisun kik le, ama uuk bangma in amate kiteang tahen. Hisia sungah khialna mawna om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahihang pa khat sia zawthawk thu taw hi ngawlin, kiteang ngawl tu in a thin a khensat le, tuaciang ama deina ki uk takpi zo a, a vawt tu sia khensat zo ahi nale, tua numei a teenpui buale a pha in ngamta ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ahikom zi nei sia zongh thupha seam hi a, ahihang zi nei ngawl pasal sia in thupha seam zaw lai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Pasal nei numei khat in a pasal nuntak laiteng a suakta bua hi; ahihang a pasal a thi le a teenpui nop pawpo taw a kiteen thei natu in suakta hi, ahizong Tapidaw khat ahile bek teenpui thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahihang ama ii om ngei in om pole pasal a nei kik sangin a lungdam zaw tu hi. Tua in keima ngaisutna hi a, tuaciang keima zongh Pathian ii Thaa nei in ka kingaisun hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu in milim biakna ah a kizangh an huvau lai nong thaak uhte kong son tu hi. Amate ci bangma in, “Eite theampo in heakna ih nei hi,” ci thu in thumaan ahi hi. Ahizong tuabang heaknate in mihing khat kisatheisak hi; ahihang itna in lemh tawto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kuama po he a kisa sia in a heak tu bang tatakin he ngawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian a it mihing khat sia Pathian in he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, milim biakna in a kizangh an neakna huvau ah: milim ih ci sia a om takpi ngawl khat ii taang ahi sia ih he hi; eite in Pathian khat bek om ahi hunlam ih he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vantung ah ahizong leitung ah ahizong “pathiante” a kicite a om hial zong, tuaciang “pathiante le topate” tam ma om kale zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />eite atu in Pa ahi Pathian khat bek om hi, ama sia na theampo a Bitphuapa hi a, ama atu in eite a nungta ih hi hi; tuaciangin Topa khat bek ahi Jesus Christ om a, ama tungtawnin na theampo kibitphua a, ama tungtawnin eite ih nungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang hi thumaan thutak sia mihing sim in he ngawl hi. Tuni dong ma mihing pawlkhat te in milimte huvau ah kingeinasee zo a, tua a piaksa an a neak uh ciang milim khat ii neisa an ne bangin kingaisun lai uh hi; amate sia thu tel zo ngawl ahikom, tua an in amate ninsak ci in ngaisun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahizong an in Pathian taw kizopna phatuamsak ngawl tu hi; ih neak ngawl hang bangma ih sumh buatu a, ih neak hang zong bangma kimeet tuan ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahizong note suakta in na ngamtatna in, upna ah a thaneam mihingte mawna sungah na puksak ngawl natu in na kidawm tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sonteena in hi thu huvau ah “heakna” a ci sia a nei note ii milim biakbuk ah na anneak uh, ngaisutna thazawm mihing khat in hong mu tu ci leang; tuasia in milim biakna ah a kizangh an a neak ngam natu in thapia suak ngawl tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama atu in Christ a thi, hi a thaneam na suapuipa sia nang ii “heakna” hu in lal tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi bangin, na Tapidaw suapuite tungah na maw uh ciang le amate ii a thazawm ngaisutna na belap uh ciangin Christ tungah a maw na tang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom an in ka suapuipa a khialsak le, ka suapuipa sia mawna sungah ka puksak ngawl natu in, sa ka ne kik ngei nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima sia a suakta mihing khat hi ngawl khi ziam? Sawltakpa khat hi ngawl khi ziam? Ih Topa Jesus mu ngei hi ngawl khi ziam? Topa atu ka sepna ii a nga sia note hi ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngualdangte in sawltak khat bangin hong saang bua phial zong, note in nong saan tu uh ahi hi! Topa taw kipumkhat a na nuntak uh hu in, noma mama sia sawltak khat ka hina a kilakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihingte in hong sit ciang, hisia in keima le keima ka kihuukna ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka nasepna hu in kei in an le tuite hong kipiak natu thu om hi ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sawltak dangte, Topa suapuite le Peter ettee in, ka khualhaw ciang ka kitholpui tu Tapidaw zi khat nei thei natu thu om hi ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahibuale koma kivaak natu zongin na a seam sia Barnabas le kei bek hi khu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama ii sum zangh a, ngalkap sung a seam ngalkap om ngei na ziam? A sapithuan sung pan a piang sapitnga a ne ngawl lothopa akua om ngei ziam? Ama tuute ii noai a ne ngawl tuucingpa a om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni sim a ettee thei hi bangte taw keima le keima ka kidep tu kul ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile Thukham in tuabang ma in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses Thukham sungah, “Khuital khat an cil in na zak uh ciangin, a muk na tuamsak heak vun,” ci in ih sim hi. Tu in, Pathian in khuitalte a thinnuammaw ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in tuabang a ci ciang koma hong cinopna tatak hi ngawl ziam? Hi hi, tua thu in koma atu in a ki at ahi hi. Lothopa le anlapa in an a kilate hawm khawm tu ci in lametna taw diang ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kote in note sungah thaa thaicii kong poai uh hi. Tuaciang note tung panin, leitung hamphatnate nga le ung tam lei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngualdangte in note tung panin, hite nga natu lametna nei thei ahile, ko in a lianzaw ngawngawn muangmaw thei ngawl tu khu ziam? Ahihang hi ka nga tuak, ka zak tuak uhte hong zangh ngeingawl khu hi. Tua hizaw ngawlin, Christ huvau Lungdamna Thupha lampi a nokkhaksak ngawl natu in haksatna theampo a thuak hi zo khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Biakinn sungah naseamte in Biakinnpi panin an nga a, biaknatau tungah sangaw biakpiakna seamte in, a satel nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuasia bangma lungdamna thu a hilte in, tua ii tung panin a nuntak kivaak kitaa natu nga tu ci in Topa thupiaksa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang hi ka nga tuak, ka zak tuak uhte ka zangh ngei bua a, tu a lai kong thaakna zongh tuabangte keima atu in a la nuam ka hi bua hi. Tua sangin ka thi nuamzaw hi! Hi kisaktheinate kuama in a luithawthong thu a sua buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lungdamna thu ka hil hu in, ka kisuantaak natu thu ka nei bua hi. Tuasia tatak ma seam tu in hong kisawl hi. Tuaciang lungdamna thu hil bua leng kei atu in bangza in lauhuai tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima uuk thu in ka tealna taw ka nasep seam hi leng, thaman hong kipiak tu ka lamen tu hi; ahihang sep tu pealmaw in nei a, a seam ka hi hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian in kei hong muang a, hi vaipuak hong aap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahile bang thasum ka saang ziam? Lungdamna Thupha atu nasepna sungah nga tuakte la ngawl, sum la ngawlin, lungdamna thu hil theina hunpha ka nga sia in, ka noptuamna thupha ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima in kuama ii sila ahi ngawl, mihing suakta khat ka hi hi; ahihang mihing a tam thethei ka nga natu in ngual theampo ii sila ka kisuaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jew te taw na ka sepkhop laitakin, amate ka nga thei natu in Jew khat taw kibangin ka nungta hi; Moses Thukham ukna nuai ah om ngawl ka hi hang, tuabang a omte ka nga thei natu in, Thukham ukna nuai ah a omte bangin ka ngamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuasia bangma Gentile te taw na ka sepkhop ciangin, amate ka nga thei natu in, Jew Thukham puasia ah a om Gentile te khat bangin ka om hi. Hi bangin ih ci ciang, Pathian thukham ni ngawl khi hi ka cinopna hi ngawl hi; a tatak sia Christ ii Thukham nuai ah ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Upna thaneamte kawm ah ka om ciang, amate ka nga thei natu in, amate khat bangin thaneam in ka om hi. Tua ahikom ahithei tu lampi khat po taw ahizong amate pawlkhat beak ngupna a nga thei natu in, mihing theampo ii a diksak thethei tu in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hite theampo sia lungdamna thu hangin thupha ka hop thei natu a seam ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tai kidemna sungah a kihel tam mama ahihang amate sung pan a zo khat bek in zawna tel nga ahi hunlam sia na heak uh ahi hi. Tua ahikom zawna tel na nga thei natu in tai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A kikhomsuan ngawl paakkual lukhu khat a kikhuksak natu in, a kimai khat sim in a sinna sungah a haksa mama kitekna nuai ah kipum aap hi; ahihang eite ih hile, a tawntungin a kip tel atu in ih seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua hu in matut natu mun khau kithungna dong ah, tang takin ka tai hi; tuasia hu ma in ngual a thong khial ngawl kithok thiampa taw ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua kidemna ah ngual thato zo kasap a kihel zo ngawl pa ka sua ngawl natu in keima le keima kithongin ka pumpi ka ngimsakin ka kitek dipdeap hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Suapuite awng, Moses nungzui ih taanghpupite tungah bang piang ziam ci in na phawk kik natu ka dei hi. Amate a vekpi in meeikaai ii dalna nuai ah om a, San Tuipi kaantanin suakta siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meeikaai sung le tuipi sungah, amate teng Moses nungzui a hina uh taw ki baptize uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A vekpi in thaa anluum a kibangin ne uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />thaa tui a kibangin dawn uh hi. Amate taw a tonkhawm thaa suangpi panin tui dawn uh hi; tua suangpi sia Christ ama mama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabang ahibel hang, amate a tamzaw tungah Pathian in diksa ngawl ahikom a luanghawm uh sia sennealngam sungah kithethaang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu in hite theampo sia eite atu in, ettee tu lim hi a, amate dei bangin a sia nate ih dei ngawl natu kidopna hong piakna hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua bek hi ngawlin, amate pawlkhat ii milim a biak bangin, ih biak ngawl natu in kidop natu hong piak ahi hi. Laithiangtho ci bangin, “Mihingte in zuneakna le numei le pa maitatna a om poai sungah kihel uh hi”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eite sia amate pawlkhat bangin, numei le pa paktatna a vawt uh bangin ih ngamta bua het tu hi — ni khat thu in amate mihing tulkul le tulthum pukin thi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate pawlkhat bangin Topa ih ze et bua het tu hi — amate ngul in tulum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate pawlkhat bangin ih phuntaal bua het tu hi — Thina ii Vantunglalang in amate lalcipsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi thupiang theampo sia ngual ii ettee tu lim hi a, eite kidop thei natu in lai sungah a kiciamtee ahi hi. Banghang ziam cile leitung bo kuan hun sungah eite ih om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kip takin ding a kisa pawpo in, a puk ngawl natu in kidawm tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ze etna na thuaksa uh theampo sia mihingte tungah a tung bul thute ahi hi. Ahihang Pathian in a kamciam kholet hi, tuaciang ama in a kipin na om thei natu note thuak zawk ngawl tu ze etna hong thuaksak ngawl tu hi; hong kize et ciangin zongh thuak zawk thahatna hong pia tu a, na suatak natu lampi khat hong hon tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahiciang ka it lawmte awng, milim biakna na pial tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing thu tel theite tungah thuson tu bangin note tungah kong son hi; ka sonte sia noma le noma in na khensat tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa ii Zan An neakna hai hangin Pathian tungah lungdam ih ko hi; tua hai taw ih dawn ciang Christ ii chisan a siim khawmte ih hi hi. Tuaciang anluum ih balneen hi: hi a kibalneen anluum ih neak ciang, Christ ii pumpi a siim khawmte ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile tua anluum sia khat bek hi a, ei teng tam ih hihang, anluum khat bek nekhawm tek ih hi manin eite pumkhat ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel mite thu ngaisun vun; sangaw biakpiakna an a nete in, Pathian biaknatau nasepna sungah a kihel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahile milim, ahibuale milim biakna ah a kipia ante thupisak ka hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi ngawl hi! Ka cinopna in doai biate ii biaknatau tungah sa ngawte sia doaite atu a kipia hi a, Pathian tungah a kipia hi ngawl hi. Tuaciang doaite taw na kipawlkhop tu ka dei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa hai le doaite hai pan zong, na dawnkhawm thei buatu uh hi; Topa sabuai le doaite sabuai zongh zangh khawmin an na ne thei buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahibuale Topa sia a eang pa suaksak nuam ih hi ziam? Ama sangin eite hat zaw kisa ih hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in, “Na theampo vawt thei natu thu ih nei hi,” ci uh hi. Tua thu maan hi, ahihang na theampo pha siat ngawl hi. “Na theampo vawt thei natu thu ih nei hi,” — ahihang na theampo in hong hu thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kuama in ama phat tuam natu a et tu hi ngawlin, ngualdangte phattuam natu a et thei tu kisamh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sa kizuakna munah a kizuak theampo na neak thei natu in suatakna na nei uh a, thinnopmawkna taw bangma dok kul ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in, “Leitung le a sungah a om na theampo sia Topa ii neisa ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thu um ngawl khat in an ne tu in hong sam a, pai na sawm le thin nopmawkna taw bangma dongh se ngawlin na mai ah hong kilui po ne in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahihang khat po in, “Hi an sia milim a kipia an hi,” hong cile, tua an sia hong sonpa le ama ii thinsung ngaisutna na khualna taw ne heak vun —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tuabang ka ci ciang, noma thinsung ka cina hi ngawlin, hong sonpa thinsung ka cinopna ahi hi. Hi thu tungtaang ah khat po in, “Tua ahile pha hi, ngualdang khat ii ngaisut natu khualna in, ka uk bang ka ngamtat tu, banghangin hong kikhaktan thei tu ziam, ci thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka an atu in, Pathian tungah lungdam ka ko nale, banghangin ngualdang khat in lungdam ka ko sa an huvau sia bangbangin hong sit thei tu ziam,” a ci om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pha hi, bang pawpo na vawt zong, bang pawpo na ne na dawn zong, Pathian minthan natu in na hi vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jew te atu ahizong Gentile te atu ahizong, Pathian ii pawlpi atu ahizong, haksatna a piangsak ngawl nuntakzia taw nungta tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Keima vawt bangin vawt po vun; ka vawt theampo sungah mihing khat sim ka lungkimsak natu in ka hanciam a, amate ngupna a nga thei natu in, keima phattuam natu ngaisun ngawlin, a vekpi phattuam natu ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Christ ii zia le tong ka zui bangin, kei ii zia le tong hong zui tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nong phaw tawntung uh hu le note tungah kong piak hilciannate na zui uh hu in kong pok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang na tel tu uh ka dei thu pan, Christ in mihing theampo tungsia ah a lianbel hi a, pasal in zi tungsia ah a lianbel hi, Pathian in Christ tungsia ah a lianbel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom pasal khat in, mihon sungah a thunget ciang ahizong, Pathian thu a thansak ciang ahizong, a lu tungah khuk khat a nei le, Christ mindaisak suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang numei khat pawpo in mihon sungah thu a nget ciang ahizong, Pathian thu a thansak ciang ahizong, a lu tungah bangma a om buale, a pasal mindaisak suak a; a lu a meettol numei dangkhat taw, kilamdanna nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua nu in a lu tungah khuk khat a nei buale, a sam zongh a meet vet tu ahi hi. Tuaciang khat in a lu a tol in meet tu ahibuale a sam a tan tu sia maizumhuai thu ahi bangma a lu tungah tuamna khat nei le pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasal khat in a lu seal kul ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile ama in Pathian lim le vaangletnate, ama tung panin kilanghsak hi. Ahihang numei in pasal vaangletna a kilanghsak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />banghang ziam cile pa sia numei sung panin kibitphua ngawlin, numei sia pa sung pan kibitphua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pa in numei atu kibitphua hi ngawl a, ahihang numei in pa atu in a kibitphua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahiciang vantunglalangte hangin, numei in a pasal ii thuneina nuai ah om hi, ci in lak natu in a lu tuamna khat nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang Topa sung ih nuntakna ah, numei in pasal ngawl taw tuam din thei ngawl a, pasal zongh numei ngawl taw tuam din thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile numei sia pasal panin a kivawt bangma in, pasal zongh numei sung pan a suak ahi hi; tuaciangin na theampo a piangsak sia Pathian ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lu tungah bangma a om ngawl numei khat sia mihon biak piakna sungah Pathian tung thu a nget tu sia a kilawm le a kilawm ngawl noma in khensat tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Banghang ziam, leitung pianzia mama zongh in pasal khat sam a sau in a hoai le a maizumhuai hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ahihang numeite tungah tuasia in hoina khat hi ci in hong hil hi. Numei samsau sia ama a kituam natu in, a kipia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang khat po in hi thu a nial nuam tha le, eite ih hi zong, Pathian ii pawlpite ahizong, biakpiakna ah ngeina dang kinei ngawl hi ci sia bekma son tu ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi a nuai ah ngamtatzia tu hilnate sungah ahile no kong pok bua hi, banghang ziam cile biak kikhopna ah a tatakin phatna sangin siatna piang zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A masa phitbel in na kikhopna uh sungah a kilangpan pawl tuatuamte om hi ci in hong kison hi; hisia in a maan na mun om tu ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />(No sungah thutangzaw sia a kimu thiang natu in kikhennate ahile a om kul hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pawl in na kikhop uh ciang, na neak uh sia Topa ii Zan An hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile na neak uh ciang mihing khat sim in, noma an tek ma leap papaih na hi uh kom pawlkhat sia ngilkial in na om uh a, a dang teng sia zukham in om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuabangin na neak na dawn natu uh, inn tek nei hi ngawl nu ziam? Tua ahibuale Pathian ii pawlpi zawngsakin, a nei ngawlte na maizumsak nopna uh ziam? Hi thu huvau ah bang son tu in nong muangmaw uh ziam? No hong pok tu khi ziam? Hong pok ngawl het tu khi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Topa ii hilcianna ama ii tung pan ka saante sia note tungah kong pia sawn hi: a thu in Topa Jesus a kileeheak tu nitakin, ama in anluum la a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian munah lungdam a ko zawkciang anluum balneen a, “Hisia in note atu in a kipia ka pumpi ahi hi. Kei nong phawna in hi bangin vawt vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuasia bangma zan an a neak zawkciang ama in hai la in, “Hi hai in ka chi taw a kikipsak Pathian ii thuciamna thak ahi hi. Na dawn uh simin, kei nong phawna in na dawn vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hisia ii khiakna sia, hi anluum na neak uh sim le, hi hai panin na dawn uh simin ama hong pai kik dongin, Topa ii thina thu a thangsak na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi thu taw kipee in khat po in, ama zatak ngawlna taw Topa ii anluum ne a, hai a dawn le, tua mi in Topa ii pumpi tung le a chi tungah a maw ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahikom mihing sim in, ama le ama kisittel phot tu a, tua zawkciang anluum ne in, hai panin dawn tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile anluum a neak ciang le hai panin a dawn ciangin, Topa ii pumpi ii a khiakna a tel buale, a neak a dawn hu in ama le ama tungah thukhenna a tungsak suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua hu in note sungah mihing tam mama thazawmin a ciina a, tam ma na thi zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Eima le eima kisittel phot in hi leang, Pathian thukhenna sungah ih theng buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahihang eite sia leitung bup taw hong kimawsak ngawl natu in, Topa in thu hong khen a, daan hong pia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Suapuite awng, tua ahikom, Topa ii Zan An ne tu in, na kikhoptua uh ciangin, khat le khat na kingak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuaciang na kikhop uh ciangin a ngilkial khat po a om le, Pathian ii thukhenna nuai ah na tum ngawl natu in inn ah an ne tahen. Thudangte sia, kong pai ciangin ih son tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu in Thaa Thiangtho letsong huvau nong at uh teng kong son tu hi. Ka suapuite awng, tuate huvau thumaan thutak sia na heak tu uh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian he ngawlte na hi uh lai in, note sia nuntakna a nei ngawl milimte biakna sungah lampialna tam mama taw hong kipaipui ahi sia na heak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian Thaa ii a lampuite kuama in, “Jesus in haamsiat thuak hen,” ci thei ngawl a, tuaciang Thaa Thiangtho ii lamlakna a om ngawl po kuama in, “Jesus in Topa hi,” ci thei ngawl hi ci thu kong hesak nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thaa Thiangtho letsongte sia a nam tuatuam om hi, ahihang a kibang Thaa khat bek in tuate pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nasepna a nam tuatuam om hi, ahihang a kibang Topa khat atu kiseam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sepna sungah thiamna nam tuatuam om hi, ahihang mihing sim atu amate sepna san tek ah thiamna nam tuatuam a pia Pathian sia a kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing theampo phattuam natu in mihing khat sim sungah Thaa a om hunlam a nanamin kilak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thaa in mihing khat tungah ciimna taw kidim thu khat pia a, a dang khat tungah tua Thaa ma in heakna taw kidim thu khat pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua a kibang Thaa khat sia ma in mihing khat tungah upna pia a, a dang khat tungah ciina damsak theina vaang pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thaa in khat tungah nalamdang lak theina vaang pia a; a dang khat tungah Pathian Thuhil theina letsong pia hi; tuaciang a dang khat tungah, letsongte sia Thaa Thiangtho pan hong pai ahile ahi ngawl khentel theinate pia lai hi. Khat tungah kam tumdang pau theina pia a, a dang khat tungah kam tumdangte pheen theina pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang hite theampo a vawtpa in a kibang Thaa khat bek ahi hi; tuaciangin ama uuk babangin letsong tuatuam mihing khat sim tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Christ in khen tuatuam tam mama a nei pumpi khat taw kibang hi. Khen tuatuam nei ahihang, pumpi khat hi veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in, eite theampo sia Jew te ih hizong, Gentile te ih hizong, sila le sila ngawlte ih hizong, a kibang Thaa khat in, pumpi khat sungah hong ki baptize a, tuaciangin ih dawn tu in Thaa khat sia ei theampo hong kipia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile pumpi in khen khat bek taw a kivawt bua a, khentuam tam mama taw a kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Peang in, “Kei sia khut hi ngawl ka hi ciang pumpi ii neisa ka hi bua hi,” cile zong tua in pumpi ii khen khat a hina a bosak tuan buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciangin bil in, “Kei sia mittang hi ngawl ka hi ciang, pumpi neisa ka hi bua hi,” cile zong tua in pumpi ii neisa a hina a bosak tuan buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pumpi buppi in mittang khat hile bangbangin khua za thei tu ziam? Tuaciangin bil bek hile bangbangin a ngimnam he thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahizong Pathian in pumpi khen tuatuamte sia ama deina sasan tek ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A buppi in a khen tuam nam khat bek hile pumpi a om buatu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A khentuam tam mama om ahihang pumpi khat bek om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom mittang in khut kungah, “Nang kong tulmaw bua hi!” ci thei ngawl tu hi. Lutang in peang munah, “Nang kong tulmaw bua hi!” ci thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua hi ngawlin, pumpi sungah a thazawm tuak zaw pumpi khentuamte ngawl taw bangma ih vawt thei bua hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuaciangin kimanna tam nei ngawlin ih hen tua khentuamte sia ih thupi vawt tu te hizaw hi; tuaciang pumpi khentuamte sungah a et hoi keak ngawlte ahile ciliapna taw a tuan in ih kep kul a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tuabang kep tuam tu sia pumpi sungah a hoi zaw khentuamte in a tulmaw bua hi. Pathian mama in ciliap tu a taangsamh khentuamte a kiciliap thei zawk natu in pumpi sia ngawmtua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuabangin pumpi sungah kikhenna a om bua hi, ahihang ama ii khen tuatuamte khat le khat kithinbotna nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pumpi sungah khen tuam khat in, thuakna a nei le, a dang khentuam theampo in thuakpui hi; khentuam khat a kipok le, a dang khentuam teng in lungdam pui tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Note theampo in Christ ii pumpi na hi uh a, tuaciang khat sim sia tua ii khentuam khat veu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pawlpi sungah Pathian in a vekpi ma a om natu san tek ah koi hi: a masa phit in sawltakte, a niina ah kamsaangte, a thumna ah lai hil syate; tua zawkciangin nalamdang lakna a vawtte, tua zom ah ciidamsakna vaang a kipiate, ngual hu thei ahibuale, lamlak thiamte, tua ahibuale kam tumdang taw a paute ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate in sawltakte, kamsaangte, lai hil syate hi siat ngawl hi. Mihing khat simin nalamdang lakna vawt thei natu in vaang ahizong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />ciina damsak theina ahizong, kam tumdang taw pauna le tua kamte pheen theina ahizong, vawt theina vaang a nei kim bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahikom, letsong a thupizawte deibel in na nei tavun. Ahitazong, a vekpi sung pan a phabel sia in a nuai a bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihingte ii kampaute le vantunglalangte ii kampau ngawngawn ka pau thei hial hangin, itna ka nei buale ka paute sia zam nging daak nging bang bek ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian ii hu mop thuhil theina nei a; heakna theampo le thuku theampo telna nei a, mualte khiin zawk natu a kisamh upna teng ka nei hangin — itna ka nei buale kei sia bangma ka hi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka neisa na theampo pia siatin, ka pumpi ngawngawn a kihallum tu dongin, ka piak hial hangin, itna ka nei buale, hite in kei atu bangma phatna hong pia bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Itna in thin uai a, dik hi; itna in ki eenna nei ngawl a, kisathei ngawl, kiphasak ngawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />itna in philphit ngawl, duhop ngawl, thintom ngawl hi; itna in ngual khialnate ciamtee ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Itna in ngitlona thu ah lungdam ngawl hi, thumaan thutak ah lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Itna in thinkiam ngeingawl a; a upna, a lametna le a thinsauna bo ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Itna in a tawntungin kip hi. Kamsaannate om ahihang tawmvei atu bek ahi hi; kam tumdangte pau theina letsongte om ahihang bo tu hi; heakna letsong om ahihang bo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile eite heakna le kamsaanna letsongte sia a cingtaak hi ngawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahihang a kicing sia hong thet ciangin a cingtaak ngawl teng bo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Patang ka hi lai in ka pauna, ka phawna, ka khua ngaisutte in patang bang ahi hi; tu in pasal khat ka hi ciangin patang vai teng ka nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu in ih muna in, limlangh sungah a kimu thiang ngawl lim le meal bang ahi hi; tua hun ciangin maitang kisi in ih kimu tu hi. Tu a ka heak sia kicing tak ngawl lai hi; tua zawkciang Pathian in kei hong heakna bangma in, a kicingin ka he tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu laitakin a taanglai thu thum teng sia: upna, lametna le itna hi a; hi teng sung pan a lianbel sia in itna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahikom na hanciam tu uh sia, ki itna ahi hi. Thaa Thiangtho letsongte, a tuanin Pathian thu thansak theina letsong na lungngul vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kam tumdang a pau sia in ngualdang tungah pau hi ngawlin, Pathian tungah pau ahi hi, banghang ziam cile kuama in tel ngawl hi. Ama in Thaa vaangletna taw a kiseal thumaan thutakte son ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian thu a thangsakte in mihingte tungah pau hi a, amate tungah huna, hanthotna le heenepna pia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kam tumdang taw a paute in ama phat tuam natu bek hi a, Pathian thu a thangsakte in pawlpi bup phattuamna a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />No theampo kam tumdang pau thei le uhte kong oai hi; ahizong Pathian thu thansak theina letsong nei le uhte kong oai zaw hi. Banghang ziam cile pawlpi bup in phattuamna a nga thei natu in, no sungah a khiakna a son thei pai om ahi bua nale, kam tumdang a paute sangin Pathian thu a thangsak sia in man neizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka suapuite awng, no kungah kong pai ciangin, kam tumdangin hong pau leng, note atu in ka kimanna om tu ziam? Pathian tung pan thupualaakna, heakna, thuhilna ahibuale hilcianna khat pawpo ka nei buale note atu in bekcik zongh kimanna ka nei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nuntakna a nei ngawl tumthei tamngai ahizong, tengtonghte ahizong la in —, a aw kitelthiang vaset in a tum buale akua in bang aw hi ci in tel thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciangin ngalkap sungah lemle tumpa in, sapna aw a kitel takin, a tum buale akua ngalsim tu in kinging thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in kam tumdang taw thu na sonte a thiang buale, akua in hong tel tu ziam? Na kammalte sia vui sungah bo thong tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simleitung ah kampau nam tuatuam om hikale, tuate sung pan khiakna nei ngawl khat zongh a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang a kipau kam sia ka tel buale, hong paupui pa sia kei atu in ngamdang mi suak a, ama mun pan zong, keima sia ngamdang mi ka suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thaa ii letsongte nga tu sia lawp na hi uh ciang, nadang theampo sangin pawlpi a khanto thei natu a hu tu in tua letsongte zak vaial tu na hanciambel vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kam tumdang a pau sia in ama son teng a khiakna pheen theina letsong a nga natu in, thungen nanak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile kam tumdang taw thu ka nget ciangin, ka thaa taw thungen takpi ka hihang ka thungetna sungah ka ngaisutna kihel ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahile bangbangin ngamta tu khi ziam? Ka thaa taw thu ka ngen tu hi, ahizong ka ngaisutna taw zong thu ka ngen tu hi; ka thaa taw la ka sa tu hi, ahihang ka ngaisutna taw zong lasa tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian tungah lungdam na ko ciangin thaa bek taw na ko le, kikhopna sungah a kihel mihing thawthong khat in, nang lungdamko thungetna sia “Amen” bangbangin hong ci pui thei tu ziam? Ama in nang pauna teng a tel thei natu thu om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian tungah lungdamkona na thungetna sia pha teei ahihang ngualdang khat in phat tuamna nei ngawl het hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />No sangin kam tumdang tamzaw pau ka hikomin, Pathian ka pok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang pawlpi biak kikhopna sungah ngualdangte hilna tu in, kam tumdang kammal a tul simin ka pau sangin, a kitel thei kammal nga ka pau zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, na khua ngaisutna uh ah, patang bang hi heak vun; siatna lam ah patang bang na hi vun, ahihang khua ngaisutna ah na khanthin vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Laithiangtho sungah, “Kam tumdangte a pau mihingte tungtawnin, ka mihingte tungah ka pau tu hi, Topa in ci hi. Ngamdangmite kam le muk tungtawnin ka pau tu hi, tua ahitazongin ka mite in kei hong ngai buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahikom, kam tumdang pauna letsong sia thu um ngawlte atu in a maan lakna hi a, thu umte atu hi ngawl hi, thuhilna letsong ahile thu umte atu in a maan lakna hi a, thu um ngawlte atu hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahikom pawlpi bup kikhawm hen a, tuaciangin mihing sim in, kam tumdangte taw a pau siasua laitakin — mihing thawthong pawlkhat ahizong, thu um ngawl pawlkhat ahizong hong pai le, note sia mawmaw siat hi hong ci ngawl tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang mihing khat simin Pathian thu a son laitakin thu um ngawl pawlkhat ahizong, mihing thawthong pawlkhat ahizong hong pai le a zaak thu taw a mawna kitel tu uh hi. Ama zaakna teng taw ama tungah thu kikhen tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ama ii thuku a ngaisut teng a pua ah hong kilangh tu a, ama in kunin Pathian bia in, “A maan tatakin Pathian sia hi sung, note sungah om hi!” ci in pualaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Suapuite awng, ka ci nop sia hi teng hi. Biakpiakna nei tu in na kikhop uh ciang, mihing khat in biakna la a sak tu khat nei tu a, a dang khat in hilciannatu khat, a dangkhat in Pathian tung pan thupualaakna, a dang khat in kam tumdang taw thusonna, a dangkhat ma in thu kison teng pheen theina, nei tu hi. Na theampo sia pawlpi phattuamna ahi tu kisamh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khat po in kam tumdang a pau le, nii ahibuale a tambel in thum in pau tu a, tua zom ah khat zawkciang khat in a ban in pau tu hi, tuaciangin a dangkhat in a kipau teng ii khiakna a pheen kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahihang a pheen thei a om buale, kam tumdang a paute thim tahen a, ama le Pathian kilaklaw bek ah pau tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian thupuak a sang nii le thum te in son tu a, a dangte in, a pauna teng sia a maan le a maan ngawl khensat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahizong kikhopna sungah a to khat po in, Pathian ii thupuakna a saang le, a pau masa sia tawlnga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na vekpi in khat zawkciang khat in, Pathian thupuak sia thangsak thei tu nu hi, tuasia ciangin mihing sim in, heakna hong nei tu a, tha hong nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pathian thu thansak thei na letsong sia a pau sia ii ukna nuai ah om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian in note sia ahi bialbual tu in hong dei ngawl a, thu kihual le a kilem tu in hong dei hi. Pathian ii mihingte ii pawlpi theampo te ah a kizangh bangma in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />numeite sia kikhopnate sungah thim khipkhep in om tu hi. Amate a pau tu ki oai ngawl hi; Jew te thukham ii a ci bangma in amate sia a ukte hi thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate in bang khat po heak nop a nei le, inn ah a pasalte uh dongh tahen. Pawlpi sungah numeite a pau tu sia kilawm ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ahibuale Pathian kammal sia no kung panin hong pai a hi thei tu ziam?. Tua ahibuale note tung bek ah hong tung a hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mihing khat po in ama le ama Pathian kamtaipa a kisa a, tua ahibuale thaa letsong nei a kisa le, tu a note tungah kong at teng sia Topa thupiak hi ci in tel nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahizong ama in hi thu a nadon buale ama na nadon heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka suapuite awng, Pathian thuthansakna ah, na lungngul tavun a, ahizong kam tumdang paunate na khaam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na theampo ahi tu bang le, a kiphu a kilawm bangin vawt tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, na saansa uh le na upna tung kho tak na dinna uh, kong hil Lungdamna Thupha huvau tu in kong phawksak kik nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua lungdamna thu sia note tungah kong hil sia ahi hi. A luithawthong in a um na hi buana uh a, pha takin lungdamna thu na kholet uhle tua thupha in note hong ngum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima ii ka nga sa teng note tungah kong pia sawn hi, tua thu in thupibel hi: banghang ziam cile Laithiangtho ii at bangma in Christ in eite ii mawna hangin thi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuaciang ama kiphum a, ni thum zawkciangin Laithiangtho ii at bangma in nuntakna sungah kithosak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ama in Peter kungah kilak a, tua zawkciang sawltak sawm le nii teng kungah kilak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama sia a nungzui 500 vaalte kungah thakhatin kilak a, tuate sung pan pawlkhat thi zo ahihang a tamzaw sia nungta nginge lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciang ama in James kungah kilak a, tua zawkciang sawltakte theampo kungah kilak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in nau a sua tu hunin a suak ngawl khat bang ka hi tazongin — a khakbel in kei tung zongh ah hong kilak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile keima in sawltak sung panin a nobel ka hi a — sawltak khat ci in minpu tu zong ka kilawm bua hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian ii pawlpi ka vawtsia ngei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian ii thuthiamna taw keima sia hi bang ciang ka hi a, ama hong piak thuthiamna sia a luithawthong a suak bua hi. Kei sia sawltak dangte sangin, nasia zaw in na ka seam hi. Tua zongh a tatakin kei ii sep hi ngawlin kei taw a om Pathian ii thuthiamna ii a sep ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom kei tung pan hong pai ahizong, amate tung pan hong pai ahizong, hisia ma ka vekpi in kong hil uh thu hi a, hisia ma in note ii up thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu in kote ii kong hil uh thu in, Christ sia thina panin kitho kiksak hi ci kasap, bangbangin note pawlkhat in a thite nuntakna sungah kithosak ngawl tu hi, ci thei nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia in thumaan ahile Christ kitho kiksak ngawl hi tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuaciang thina pan Christ tho kik ngawl hile, kote ii hil tu bangma om ngawl tu a, note ii up tu bangma om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua bek dom ngawlin kote sia Pathian tungtaang ah leilot thu son hong kici tu hi, banghang ziam cile Christ sia thina panin tho kik hi ci khu hi — ahihang mithite a nungta in kithosak ngawl hi takpi ahile, ama in Christ a thosak ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a thite nuntakna sungah tho kik ngawl hile Christ zongh kithosak ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciangin Christ kithosak ngawl hile, na upna uh sia cithep thu hong suak tu a, note sia noma mawnate sung ma ah a mangthang lai na hi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Christ sungah thu um mi a thite a bocip hi cina zongh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Christ sungah ih lametna in, hi nuntakna sung atu bekin kimang a, a dang om ngawl ahile leitung theampo ah a khuangai huai belte ih hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang thumaan thu in bang ziam cile, Christ sia thina panin a kithaw kik sakna sia, thina sungah a mute zongh, kitho kiksak tu hi ci in a kip kamciam hong piakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile thina in mihing khat tungtawnin hong pian bangma in, thina panin thawkikna zongh, mihing khat tungtawnin hong piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Adam taw a kipumkhat mihing theampo a thi bangma in Christ taw a kipumkhat theampo nuntakna sungah kitho kiksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang mihing sim amate hun tekin kitho kiksak tu hi: Christ sia a masa phitbelin tho hi; tua zawkciang ama hong pai kik ciang, ama ii mihing teng tho tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuasia ciang a tawpna hong theng tu hi; Christ in thaa lamsang ah a ukte, thuneite, vaangletna a neite theampo zo tu a, tuaciangin a Kumpi Ngam sia Pa Pathian tungah aap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian in a ngalte theampo zo a, ama peang nuai ah a koisak dong Christ in uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A khakbel a zaw tu a ngal sia thina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in, “Pathian in na theampo a peang nuai ah koi hi,” ci hi. A kithiangtel thu in “na theampo” ci ciangin, Christ ii peang nuai ah na theampo a koipa, Pa Pathian a kihel bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahihang Christ ukna nuai ah na theampo a kikoi zawkciang, Tapa ahi ama mama sia, na theampo ama nuai ah a koi Pathian nuai ah ama le ama kikoi tu hi; tuaciang Pathian in a vekpi in uk siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tu in mithite atu ki baptize na a vawtte bangbangin ih ngaisun tu ziam? Amate in bang phattuamna piangsak tu in kimuangmaw ziam? Pawlkhat ci bangin, a thite sia nuntakna sungah kitho kiksak ngawl tu ahile tua mihingte in, banghangin mithite atu ki baptize ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kote sia nai simin banghangin launa thuak hi tu khu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka suapuite awng, ni simin thina ka maingat hi! Note hu in, ih Topa Christ Jesus taw kipumkhat a, ih nuntakna hangin note sungah ka nei, hi kiphatsakna in hi bangin hong pausak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ngamsa ngilote taw kido bang phet in, hi Ephesus khua ah ka dian nate sia mihing tupnate bek hile, ka nga tu bang phattuamna om tu ziam? Mithite sia nuntakna sungah kitho kiksak ngawl tu hile, “An ne zu dawn in om tawng, banghang ziam cile zing ciangin ih thi tu hi,” ci kam teptee om bangin ih om lel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Theamna thuak heak vun. “Kitholpui pha ngawlte in ngamtatna pha lalsak hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi tu bangin khua hong phawk kik tavun a, na mawnate kheal vun. No pawlkhat in Pathian he ngawl na hi uh kom a maizumhuai na hina uh kong hesak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pawlkhat in, “Bangbangin a thisate kitho kiksak tu ziam? Amate in bangbang pumpi nei tu ziam?” ci tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />No mihing mawmaw te! Thaicii khat lei sungah na tu uh ciangin, a thi phot buale a po bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuaciang, zungtaang ahizong a dang thaicii khat pawpo ahizong, tua na tu uh thaicii sia a khangto tu, a kung po sa hi ngawlin, a thaicii nguak a tu na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pathian in tua thaicii tek sia ama dei bangin a kung pia a; thaicii khat sim atu in a kung pha pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaciangin a nungta theampo ii sa sia a kibang sa nam khat bek ahi siat bua hi; Mihing sa in nam khat hi a, nganhingte, vacimte, ngasa te ii sa in a dang nam tuam tek nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Vantung pumpite le leitung pumpite a om hi; vantung pumpi hoina le leitung pumpi hoina sia kilamdang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ni in hoina a tuam nei a, tha ii hoina, tuaciang aksite hoina a tuam tek ahi hi; aksi tetek sung zongh ah, hoina a tuatuamin om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Mithisate a kinuntak kiksak ciangin, tuabang ma hi tu hi. Pumpi a kiphum ciangin a thithei pumpi ahi hi; a kithawsak ciangin a thi maw pumpi ahi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A kiphum ciangin a meal sia in zawngkhal hi. A kithawsak kik ciangin, a mealhoi in thahat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A kiphum ciangin cii le sa pumpi hi a; a kithawsak kik ciangin, thaa pumpi ahi tu hi. Ci le sa pumpi a om bangma in, thaa pumpi zongh a om kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in “Mihing masabel Adam sia nuntakna a nei mihing in kibitphua hi,” ci hi; ahihang a khakbel Adam sia nuntakna a pia Thaa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Thaa sia pai masa ngawl hi, cii le sa hi phot a, tua zawkciang thaa hi pheang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Adam masa sia lei taw kivawt a, lei panin hong piang hi; Adam niina sia vantung panin hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Leitung ii neisa ahite sia lei taw kivawt khat taw kibang hi; vantung neisate sia vantung pan hong pai pa taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Lei taw a kivawtpa lim le meal ih puak bangma in, vantung pan hong pai Pa lim le meal ih pua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ka ci nop thu in, suapuite awng, chi le sa taw a kivawt sia in, Pathian ii Ngam lua thei ngawl a, a thithei sia in thithei ngawlna lua thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Hi a kiseal thumaan thutak sia ngai vun: Eite theampo ih thi siat buatu hi, ahihang lemle khakbel sia a kitum ciang, eite in tawmvei no sungin, ih kikheal tu hi, mitphet khat sung za in manlang tu hi. Banghang ziam cile lemle a kitum ciangin a thisate tho kik in thi kik ngei nawn ngawl tu a, ih vekpi in ih kikheal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile thina sia thithei ngawlna ah kikheal nanak tu hi; a thi tu sia a thithei ngawlin hong kikheal nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Hisia hong piang in a thithei sia a thithei ngawlin a kikheal ciang, laithiangtho kammal: “Thina kisucip zo hi; zawna kikhuangkhim zo hi!” a ci sia taangtung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />“Thina awng na zawna koisung om ziam? Thina awng, na suksiat theina vaang koisung om ziam?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Thina in, a suksiat theina vaang sia mawna panin nga a, tuaciang mawna in a vaang sia Thukham panin nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Ahihang Topa Jesus Christ tungtawnin zawna hong pia Pathian tungah lungdam ih ko hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tua ahikom, kong it suapuite awng, kip tak le maan takin om vun. Topa atu na nasep uh peuma a luithawthong suak ngawl het tu hi ci in na heak uh ahiciang Topa atu na nasepna sungah a tawntung komla vun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judea ngam ah Pathian ii mihingte huna sumkhon natu vai lai nong thaak uh sia taw kisai in kong son tu hi. Galatia ah a om pawlpite tungah ka sawl teng ma note in na vawt uh kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nipi ni simin na sum thalaw za uh taw kizui in sum pawlkhat na koituam hamtang vun a, na khol vun. Kong pai ciangin sumkhon a kul ngawl tu in na tawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kong pai zawkciang Jerusalem ah na huna letsong uhte a puak tu in pha na sak uh mihingte sawlin kiheaksakna laite taw ih paisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima pai hangin a phatuam tu le, amate taw ka tonkhawm thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Macedonia sang ka manaw zawkciangin, note kungah kong pai tu hi — Banghang ziam cile Macedonia kaantanin kong pai kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />No kungah tawmvei hunsung hong taam tu khi hi, phalbi bup hong taam tha tu khi hi. Tuasia ciang ka khualhaw kik natu mun pawpo ah ka paitan thei natu in keima nong hu thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tawmvei sung hong nawkin a kimu nuam bek hi ngawlin, Topa deina a om nale, note taw hun sau mama zak khop tu ka lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pentecost ni dong hi sung Ephesus ah ka taam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hong langpan mihing tam mama om ahihang, a lian le a vawt thamman nasep natu in hunpha tatak khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Timothy sia note kungah hong theng le, note sungah nuam a sak thei natu in na vawt vun, banghang ziam cile ama sia keima bangma in Topa atu in a seam khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kuama in ama zawngsak heak vun a, kei kung hong kilee kik thei natu in, ama khual hawna thinnuam takin a zop to thei natu in na hu nanak vun; banghang ziam cile ama sia suapui teng taw hong heak kik tu ka lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu in suapui Apollos huvau ah, ama sia suapui dangte taw no kung hong haw natu in ka hanthawn hi, ahihang tu hunin hong pai tu sia a thinzo paih ngawl hi. Hun pha a nga ciang ahile, ama hong pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pilvang in om vun, upna sungah kho takin ding vun, hang vun a thahat vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nasepna theampo ah ki itna taw seam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note in Stephanas le a innkuanpuite thu na heak uh hi; amate sia Achaia ah Tapidaw suakciilte hi a, Pathian mite atu nasepna sungah a kipiate ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Suapuite awng, hi bang mihingte ii lampuina le amate taw a diang a seam dang khat pawpo ii a lampuina na zui natu uh kong thuum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Stephanas, Fortunatus le Achaicus ii hong pai hu in ka lungdam hi; amate sia hong om thei ngawl note ii luang hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />amate in note hong thinnuamsak a, tuabangin kei zongh hong thinnuamsak hi. Hi bang mihingte sia teptee thamman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asia ngamkhen ah pawlpite in paupuina kam hong thaak hi; Aquila, Priscilla le amate inn ah a kikhawm pawlpi in Tapidaw kideisakna kamthiam taw hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi sungah suapuite theampo in paupuina kam hong thaak hi. Khat le khat suapui khat hina taw kinamh tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima Paul in hi kong paupuina lai sia: keima khut tatak taw kong at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa a it ngawl po haamsiatna thuak tahen! Maranatha — Ih Topa hong pai tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa Jesus thuthiamna note taw hong om tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Christ Jesus sungah a om note theampo tungah kong itna om tahen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
